        "title": "The maps below show the centre of a small town called Islip as it is now, and plans for its development. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><em><strong>The maps below show the centre of a small town called Islip as it is now, and plans for its development. </strong></em></span><em style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></p>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Islip Town Center Development Plans</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải </strong><strong>th&iacute;ch </strong><strong>đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-ZE0EderokonhrdxOGQOlbqckg8g\">Đề b&agrave;i Islip Town Center Development Plans y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả về sự thay đổi của trung t&acirc;m thị trấn Islip từ hiện tại đến kế hoạch ph&aacute;t triển trong tương lai.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-K5pSdLrQpoF8acxi6Wrln1gigeg\"><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Islip Town Center Development Plans với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: bản đồ minh họa bố cục hiện tại của trung t&acirc;m thị trấn Islip v&agrave; <strong>kế hoạch ph&aacute;t triển</strong> <em>(proposed plans for development)</em> trong tương lai.</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JEbsd2QXSos0HUxGNcHlF0ntgab\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HVebdDKPDoNbSExDutel4LdQgeo\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BVeFdLujWon2cIxTpmRl2ZVLgsd\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề Maps, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh đưa ra c&aacute;i nh&igrave;n tổng quan về những thay đổi ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YQUxd3mvZoD9CDxfOjBlqNLhgke\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-XmcJd3Vm0o4EwjxEvyylmI3ag1c\">Kế hoạch cho thấy một <strong>sự chuyển đổi lớn</strong> <em>(major transformation).</em></div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LrvwdVy5RovqYhxL1lnlpIZXglb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Những thay đổi đ&aacute;ng ch&uacute; &yacute;</strong> nhất bao gồm việc tạo ra <strong>khu vực chỉ d&agrave;nh cho người đi bộ</strong> <em>(pedestrian-only area)</em> v&agrave; x&acirc;y dựng <strong>đường v&agrave;nh đai k&eacute;p</strong> <em>(dual carriageway bypass)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C0uhdsgGwoKI77xgKkZlSFkigwd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LqvhdFeMUoZxZrxNwSilgmVJgBN\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WLkcdtYmdoCbPRx82yGlwGHNgjc\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch m&ocirc; tả c&aacute;c đặc điểm khu vực<strong> dựa tr&ecirc;n thời gian (hiện tại v&agrave; tương lai):</strong></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LqvhdFeMUoZxZrxNwSilgmVJgBN\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P06AdwVAioetUFx6MzilxCvvgvf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Yu4MdOZ1JoLYsQxGQNRlpNuOgsb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MfFWd7rzNoOfyax6As5l5WbjgPb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DA9Wd4PctodTUwxgjellSqICgId\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong>&nbsp;Bố cục hiện tại</strong> <em>(Current layout)</em></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ToXUd7OVloDhT2xGN2TlViYmgWf\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TC2rdMAPlox5LexeN6ylzxqxgcd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Trung t&acirc;m thị trấn Islip hiện tại c&oacute; <strong>đường ch&iacute;nh</strong> <em>(main road)</em> chạy theo hướng đ&ocirc;ng-t&acirc;y qua trung t&acirc;m, với cửa h&agrave;ng ở cả hai b&ecirc;n.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-A1Xpd96g5ooKAWxe2r5lR56Igec\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Khu vực nh&agrave; ở</strong> <em>(housing areas)</em> được đặt ở ph&iacute;a nam của đường ch&iacute;nh, trong khi trường học nằm ở ph&iacute;a t&acirc;y nam v&agrave; c&ocirc;ng vi&ecirc;n ở ph&iacute;a đ&ocirc;ng nam.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Pnb0dQBfPom43UxRA8Hlpg1HgK1\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Khu vực ph&iacute;a bắc của c&aacute;c cửa h&agrave;ng l&agrave; <strong>v&ugrave;ng n&ocirc;ng th&ocirc;n</strong> <em>(countryside).</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HKUodfK9xogC0MxTp2Wlp70ng9f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QcskdIE6RoFckExwCkClFQLsglf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UcPzdqFBqofBD1xRL88lNtv5gP1\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GXVUdjVVKo0SA1xuZW1l8Varggb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2</strong><strong>: </strong><strong>Kế hoạch ph&aacute;t triển</strong> <em>(Development plans)</em></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GXVUdjVVKo0SA1xuZW1l8Varggb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ToXUd7OVloDhT2xGN2TlViYmgWf\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KEmHdk2MkoyIqgxWJOylEbKig6g\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Đường ch&iacute;nh sẽ được thay thế bằng <strong>đường v&agrave;nh đai k&eacute;p</strong> <em>(dual carriageway bypass)</em>, chuyển đổi đường hiện tại th&agrave;nh <strong>khu vực chỉ d&agrave;nh cho người đi bộ</strong> <em>(pedestrians-only zone).</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZU75dDDa0otQ2BxH71blaeBMgpe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Khu vực n&agrave;y sẽ bao gồm trạm xe bu&yacute;t mới, trung t&acirc;m mua sắm, v&agrave; b&atilde;i đậu xe từ t&acirc;y sang đ&ocirc;ng.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Np5tdodb8oP5cDxQvhilogOIgOf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&aacute;c cửa h&agrave;ng ph&iacute;a bắc</strong> <em>(northern shops)</em> sẽ bị dỡ bỏ để nhường chỗ cho c&aacute;c cơ sở mới, trong khi <strong>c&aacute;c cửa h&agrave;ng ph&iacute;a nam</strong> <em>(southern shops)</em> sẽ được giữ lại.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RWKgdO0tAoCBd1xB7HQlW72Yg5d\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Khu nh&agrave; ở mới</strong> <em>(new housing developments)</em> được quy hoạch cho cả khu vực đ&ocirc;ng bắc v&agrave; đ&ocirc;ng nam.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Zk1PdXJkmo796oxCpYXljrhAgcb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Trường học sẽ ở y&ecirc;n vị tr&iacute; nhưng được mở rộng, c&ograve;n c&ocirc;ng vi&ecirc;n <strong>giữ nguy&ecirc;n vị tr&iacute;</strong> <em>(remain in location)</em> nhưng <strong>thu nhỏ diện t&iacute;ch</strong> <em>(reduced in size)</em> do x&acirc;y dựng đường v&agrave;nh đai.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 2080,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<p>The maps illustrate the current layout of Islip town centre and proposed plans for its development.</p>",
